    "name": "Misty Valley: A Cozy Fishing Tale",
    "steam_appid": 3677310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Misty Valley, a tranquil, cozy fishing adventure where your journey begins with the inherited of your grandfather\u2019s old fisherman\u2019s house. The valley, once full of life, now lays quiet and forgotten. Armed with a fishing rod, and an indomitable spirit, your task is clear: bring the valley back to life! Dive into serene waters, uncover hidden treasures, and restore the abandoned harbor and fish market to their former glory. As you discover rare and legendary fish, you\u2019ll slowly unlock the rich history of the valley, forming bonds with its quirky inhabitants and witnessing its revival. Ready to cast your line and restore the valley\u2019s lost charm?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Cozy, Expansive World:\u00a0</strong>Wander through the charming Misty Valley, from the foggy shores to the hidden corners of the map. Each area offers unique scenery, secrets, and opportunities to explore, all designed to evoke a sense of calm and nostalgia. The valley is alive with its own rhythm, watch as the world shifts with the changing of the day, bringing new experiences and moments to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Adventures:</strong> Explore the tranquil waters of Misty Valley and catch a variety of fish, from everyday catches to legendary species. Use your fishing skills to restore the town\u2019s economy and uncover hidden treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revive the Fish Market:\u00a0</strong>Rebuild and restore the old fish market and its stalls. As you catch more fish, you\u2019ll be able to sell them at the market, helping to revive the local economy and increase the town\u2019s prosperity. Manage the market, increase your profits, and watch the town come back to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Farming:</strong> Grow essential crops for bait and energy to support your fishing journey. Manage your small farm alongside your fishing expeditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Mystical Artifacts:</strong> While fishing and exploring, you may uncover mysterious artifacts. These can be sold to the local archaeologist, who will display them in the town\u2019s museum, adding a layer of intrigue and history to your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong> With a focus on calm, cozy gameplay, <i>Misty Valley</i> invites you to take your time and enjoy the peaceful rhythm of fishing, farming, and town restoration. Perfect for fans of relaxing, simulation-style adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Story:</strong> As you restore the valley, uncover the hidden history of Misty Valley and your grandfather\u2019s legacy. Each step of the way reveals more about the people and mysteries that shaped this forgotten place.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Misty Valley, a tranquil, cozy fishing adventure where your journey begins with the inherited of your grandfather\u2019s old fisherman\u2019s house. The valley, once full of life, now lays quiet and forgotten. Armed with a fishing rod, and an indomitable spirit, your task is clear: bring the valley back to life! Dive into serene waters, uncover hidden treasures, and restore the abandoned harbor and fish market to their former glory. As you discover rare and legendary fish, you\u2019ll slowly unlock the rich history of the valley, forming bonds with its quirky inhabitants and witnessing its revival. Ready to cast your line and restore the valley\u2019s lost charm?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Cozy, Expansive World:\u00a0</strong>Wander through the charming Misty Valley, from the foggy shores to the hidden corners of the map. Each area offers unique scenery, secrets, and opportunities to explore, all designed to evoke a sense of calm and nostalgia. The valley is alive with its own rhythm, watch as the world shifts with the changing of the day, bringing new experiences and moments to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Adventures:</strong> Explore the tranquil waters of Misty Valley and catch a variety of fish, from everyday catches to legendary species. Use your fishing skills to restore the town\u2019s economy and uncover hidden treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revive the Fish Market:\u00a0</strong>Rebuild and restore the old fish market and its stalls. As you catch more fish, you\u2019ll be able to sell them at the market, helping to revive the local economy and increase the town\u2019s prosperity. Manage the market, increase your profits, and watch the town come back to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Farming:</strong> Grow essential crops for bait and energy to support your fishing journey. Manage your small farm alongside your fishing expeditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Mystical Artifacts:</strong> While fishing and exploring, you may uncover mysterious artifacts. These can be sold to the local archaeologist, who will display them in the town\u2019s museum, adding a layer of intrigue and history to your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong> With a focus on calm, cozy gameplay, <i>Misty Valley</i> invites you to take your time and enjoy the peaceful rhythm of fishing, farming, and town restoration. Perfect for fans of relaxing, simulation-style adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Story:</strong> As you restore the valley, uncover the hidden history of Misty Valley and your grandfather\u2019s legacy. Each step of the way reveals more about the people and mysteries that shaped this forgotten place.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Misty Valley, cast your line, sail to hidden islands, and uncover secrets of the sea. Befriend charming villagers, tend your farm, and explore a world full of wonder, mystery, and gentle adventure. Your story begins where the mist meets the tide.",
